  "summary": "Bind the approved experimental action candidate for local main integration.",
  "why": "Luis approved integrating 90146c3 into main. This binds the unchanged 73d1a52 runtime, compiler repairs and finite-program history attachment, with experimental status documented. Its report records 643 passing tests and packaged replay of the 86-event Shop history without research/test imports. Full repository GREEN is not claimed: nine historical exact-reproduction comparisons remain distinguished by the approved two-producer gate, with old evidence and assertions unchanged. Rules remain artifact data; atomic context/proposal, reference check producers, recomputed control, dispatch, receipt and observation remain separate. The action profile is optional. Standalone Assent and default structural history are unchanged. Domain effects, program variants, authentication, retries, a general SDK, stable wire, cross-language parity, release and remote push are excluded. Commit references bind the full candidate closure. No paper or downstream files change; broader compiler workstreams are not marked complete.",
